exports[`check.timestamps.lock given: [case2] a repo whose timestamp hook was hand-softened with an exemption when: [t4] the index cannot be read then: the lock halts as a malfunction (exit 1) and names the unreadable index, never reads it as unstaged: lock halt output — index unreadable 1`] = `
"💥 MalfunctionError: git could not read the index, so the lock cannot verify .husky/check.timestamps.sh
